%% frame: UC4 refused after payment (analysis)
sequenceDiagram
    participant PU as PayUpfrontControl (control)
    participant Ctl as JoinTeamControl (control)
    participant Intent as PurchaseIntent (entity)
    participant Team as Team (entity)
    participant Pay as Payment (entity)
    create participant Ref as Refund (entity)
    participant UI as JoinTeamUI (boundary)

    Note over PU,Team: B5: Pay upfront verified the payment (@sec-a-pay-upfront). A7: payments for the last seat are handled one at a time
    PU->>Ctl: B5: paymentConfirmed(payment)
    Ctl->>Intent: B6: isPayable()
    Intent-->>Ctl: payable, or lapsed; then isActive(), isPurchasable() as in @fig-a-uc04-as-basic-2
    opt every B6 check passes
        Ctl->>Team: B7: admit(buyer, payment)
        Team-->>Ctl: admitted (B8 to B11 as in @fig-a-uc04-as-basic-2), or refused(reason)
    end
    opt a B6 check failed (A5), or the team refused (A6, A7)
        Ctl->>Pay: A5, A6: requireRefund(reason)
        Pay->>Ref: «create» (amount, reason)
        Ctl->>Pay: A5, A6: recordOutcome(refund required)
        Ctl->>UI: A5, A6: showRefundPending()
    end
